    <summary>Manage multiple Wi-Fi adapters from a single window.</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[
# MWC — Multi WiFi Connector

Manage multiple Wi-Fi adapters from a single window.

## Features

- WPA3-SAE, WPA3 Enterprise 192-bit, WPA2, OWE
- Multi-adapter parallel scan + tabbed UI
- Per-adapter preferences (label, band, pin, auto-reconnect)
- QR code generation + parsing
- Network quality measurement (ping RTT + packet loss)
- Signal history graph + channel band graph
- System tray + Win11 jump list
- 12 languages (ja/en/zh-Hans/zh-Hant/ko/es/fr/de/ru/ar/pt-BR)
- CLI: `mwc list/scan/connect/disconnect/qr/export`
- DPAPI password protection, Sigstore + SLSA

## Quick Start

```powershell
choco install mwc
mwc scan        # scan current adapter
mwc list        # list adapters
mwc connect -s "MySSID" -p "password"
```
    ]]></description>
